<title>USA: Meredith Corp CFO Hartsook to retire.</title>
<headline>Meredith Corp CFO Hartsook to retire.</headline>
<dateline>DES MOINES, Iowa 1997-05-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Meredith Corp, the media and marketing company, said Wednesday its chief financial officer, Larry Hartsook, announced his plan to retire August 31, 1998.  </p>
<p>A search for his successor will begin immediately, Meredith said.</p>
<p>Meredith shares were up 1/4 at 24-1/8 at mid-afternoon.</p>
<p>((--Chicago Newsdesk, 312-408-8787))</p>
